# .gitignore — SRL-2018 training-session asset folder
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This folder is the COMPLETE forensic analysis (~322 MB). Most of it is raw
# evidence output and large binaries that must NOT enter git history:
#   - huge tool-output JSON (mftecmd 50 MB, evtx 34 MB, sys hives 23 MB, ...)
#   - screencast videos / asciinema casts (~99 MB)
#   - the raw action log + transcript (contain real case data / PII:
#     hostnames, accounts nfury/tdungan, internal IPs, browser history)
#
# Only the curated, human-readable docs are committed (see the !negations).
# If you want the videos in GitLab, track them via Git LFS instead of here
# (see .gitattributes), or attach them to a GitLab Release.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Raw MCP tool-output JSON (all of it; none is curated) ---
*.json

# --- Screencast videos + asciinema casts ---
*.mp4
*.gif
*.cast

# --- Raw action log + rendered transcripts (case data / PII) ---
session-actions.log
*.transcript.txt

# --- Operational run-scripts + step scaffolding (reproducible, not docs) ---
*.sh
_step.sh
*.py

# --- Accidental nested DUPLICATE of /home/admin2/srl-2018-report (3.8 MB).
#     Canonical reports live in /home/admin2/srl-2018-report — do not commit
#     this copy. Recommend deleting the nested dir on disk too (it is clutter).
srl-2018-report/

# --- Workflow completion markers / scratch dotfiles ---
.*_done
.*.swp

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# KEEP these (curated documentation) — negations must come last
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!.gitignore
!README.md
!ATTACK-CHAIN-WORKFLOW.md
